---
layout: base.njk
title: "Bastardised Food!"
heroTitle: "Welcome to Bastardised Food"
heroSubtitle: "Bollocks to conventions!"
heroBody: "I love a traditional recipe as much as the next person, but let’s be real—sometimes you're short on ingredients, or you just want to see what happens when you mix things up. This site is a celebration of that glorious chaos."
heroOutro: "Call it a fusion, a mash-up, or a 'bastardisation'—it's about taking inspiration from classic dishes and making them your own, without taking ourselves too seriously. More importantly its about enjoying cooking and eating."
---

{% include "hero.njk" %}

<section class="latest">
    <h2>Latest Bastardisations</h2>
    <div class="post-grid">
        {% for post in collections.food %}
            <article class="post-card">
                <a href="{{ post.url }}"><img src="{{ post.data.cover_image or 'https://picsum.photos/id/63/400' }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}"></a>
                <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
                <p class="excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt or '' }}</p>
                <span class="meta">Posted: {{ post.date | date('yyyy-MM-dd') }}</span>
            </article>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>